  "description": "The Ridgemont is a simple bike. That’s a good thing. You won’t find finicky technology that needs constant adjustment, or a saddle position based on aerodynamic studies. Instead, you will find a bike designed to “just go for a ride”.\n\nThe Ridgemont will remind you that balancing on two wheels can feel magical.\n\nThe Ridgemont is user-friendly and ultra-durable with its BMX style stem and bars, and it's ready to cruise around town with its 8-speed drivetrain. All-new for this year are the Ridgemont's 27.5”wheels and tires that are made to soak up the bumps and turn up the fun meter.\n\nMatte Black is available in Small/Medium and Medium/Large.\n\nSage Green is available in Small/Medium and Medium/Large.",
